<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closes Sept Fed coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closes Sept Fed coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Coffee Growers Federation said it was closing registrations for September shipments by Federation exporters effective immediately.</p>
<p>Registrations remain open for private exporters, however.</p>
<p>Registrations for October shipments were opened to both the Federation and private exporters on Thursday, August 29.</p>
<p>-- Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
